{{template button_style}
The ButtonStyle class defines the visual appearance and behavior of buttons
in the Flint UI framework.

{{template flint_image}
A versatile image widget in Flint UI, designed for rendering images
in multiple formats including HTML (for emails and web) and plain text.

{{template image_style}
The ImageStyle class defines visual and behavioral properties for images
within the Flint UI framework.
